<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, flexDirection: 'column', background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 6, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 78, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 40', borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>成员踩坑实录：谁遇到、怎么解决</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', letterSpacing: 3 }}>主讲 · 组长 · 每人轮流发言</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: '18px 40px 8px 40px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, flex: 1 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Box style={{ background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6, padding: '3px 14px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>组长</Text></Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8' }}>统筹 / 环境</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>坑：8080 端口"没进程却绑定失败"—— Hyper-V/winnat 动态保留了端口区间</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>解：netsh excludedportrange 永久保留端口，并写进手册提醒全组</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Box style={{ background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6, padding: '3px 14px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>A</Text></Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8' }}>后端架构</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>坑：token 过期了还能用—— Hutool verify() 只验签名、不验有效期</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>解：JwtUtil 改用 validate(0)，正常/篡改/过期/空串四种 token 全测一遍</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, flex: 1 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Box style={{ background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6, padding: '3px 14px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>B</Text></Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8' }}>后端业务</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>坑：接口被 Postman 直调，水量 / 电量可被任意伪造；power 与语义字段还出现过矛盾数据</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>解：sanitizeAction 统一清洗入口 + 水量改后端按分钟推算 + 修复脚本扳正历史数据</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Box style={{ background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6, padding: '3px 14px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>C</Text></Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8' }}>前端框架</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>坑：两套选项数组类型传错，ArkTS 编译失败，且报错行号不在根因位置</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>解：DeviceOptions 统一声明收口；排查时先看实参来源声明，再看报错行</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, flex: 1 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Box style={{ background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6, padding: '3px 14px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>D</Text></Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8' }}>前端页面</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>坑：轮询在跑、界面不刷新—— ForEach 只用 id 当 key；改数组元素也不触发 @State</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>解：key 拼上会变的字段 + slice() 造新数组整体赋值</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Box style={{ background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6, padding: '3px 14px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>组长</Text></Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8' }}>统筹 / UI 与文档</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>坑：整库中文集体变"?"且不可逆——导入客户端没走 utf8mb4</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>解：导入铁律写进脚本注释 + db_tool verify 自带中文 HEX 校验，杜绝问号乱码</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 58, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 40' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>智慧家居 App（仿米家）· 课程结项答辩</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>22 / 24</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
